    <string name="dialog_xiaomi_pin_title">Allow Home screen shortcuts</string>
    <string name="dialog_xiaomi_pin_body">Xiaomi HyperOS / MIUI blocks apps from pinning widgets and shortcuts by default.\n\n1. Tap \"Open permissions\" below.\n2. Open \"Other permissions\" → enable \"Home screen shortcuts\" (Always allow).\n3. Return here and tap Add again.\n\nOr add manually: long-press your Home screen → Widgets → Android widgets → Vibe Debug.</string>
