    <string name="dialog_generic_pin_title">Add manually from Home screen</string>
    <string name="dialog_generic_pin_body">Your launcher didn\'t confirm the pin request. This usually happens when Home screen layout is locked or your ROM restricts automatic shortcuts.\n\n1. Unlock Home screen layout in launcher settings (or allow \"Home screen shortcuts\" in App info on Vivo / ColorOS).\n2. Or long-press an empty space on your Home screen → Widgets → Vibe Debug.</string>

